# Bulk tracked files kept out of Grep, rg and Glob (issue 67). ripgrep reads
# this file in gitignore syntax; git does not, so `git grep` and `rg --no-ignore`
# still see everything, and Read still opens any of these by path.
# docs/ci.md stays searchable: CLAUDE.md sends agents to it.
# tests/unit/scripts/test_ignore_file.py holds that every pattern still matches
# a tracked file.

# Lockfiles.
**/uv.lock
apps/swarm-ui/package-lock.json

# The contract change log (about 970 KB).
docs/contract-change-requests.md

# Fixtures, rendered manifests and generated permission lists.
tests/unit/scripts/fixtures/workspace_guard_corpus.json
install/manifest.yaml
docs/design/day-one/manifest.draft.yaml
terraform/bootstrap/doctor-role-permissions.json

# HTML mock-up folders above about 100 KB.
docs/web-ui/mockups/
docs/design/mockups/
